 195:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcarith.c **** 
 196:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcarith.c **** /*
 197:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcarith.c ****  * The core arithmetic encoding routine (common in JPEG and JBIG).
 198:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcarith.c ****  * This needs to go as fast as possible.
 199:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcarith.c ****  * Machine-dependent optimization facilities
 200:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcarith.c ****  * are not utilized in this portable implementation.
 201:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcarith.c ****  * However, this code should be fairly efficient and
 202:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcarith.c ****  * may be a good base for further optimizations anyway.
 203:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcarith.c ****  *
 204:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcarith.c ****  * Parameter 'val' to be encoded may be 0 or 1 (binary decision).
 205:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcarith.c ****  *
 206:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcarith.c ****  * Note: I've added full "Pacman" termination support to the
